  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "The VIX is FINALLY breaking down - These Stocks Caught My Attention 👀",
  "body_html": "<p>We have been in a consistent downtrend since 19 February 2025. Patiently waiting for the volatility index (VIX) to break down. It finally appears to be doing so. Will it trend down? No idea, but if it does, it is in the early stages. It is here where we figure out if pivot points and volatility contraction patterns are working. This does NOT mean go full portfolio…something you should never do anyway after such decimation in the markets. But we can start testing the market again and seeing if set ups are working. </p><p>These 4 stocks caught my attention…👇</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-reversal/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-reversal/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "We have been in a consistent downtrend since 19 February 2025. Patiently waiting for the volatility index (VIX) to break down. It finally appears to be doing so. Will it trend down? No idea, but if it does, it is in the early stages. It is here where we figure out if pivot points and volatility contraction patterns are working. This does NOT mean go full portfolio…something you should never do anyway after such decimation in the markets. But we can start testing the market again and seeing if set ups are working.",
